From 0aaff79a35950602a1d86115487d3535e7efbfa6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Senior Matthew <SeniorMatt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 09:10:49 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 16/22] Search: a setting must match through its own text or
 section, not its page's keywords

Every setting of the Mouse page matched "mouse pointer speed" because the words
were found in the page name and keywords. Generated index: drop the generic
dialog buttons (Cancel, OK, Add...), which lead nowhere.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X5N5x9eWzmrq6QYrYLwQnk
---
 app/SettingsSearchModel.cpp | 44 +++++++++++++++++----------
 app/SettingsSearchModel.h   |  4 ++-
 app/settingsindex_p.h       | 60 -------------------------------------
 3 files changed, 32 insertions(+), 76 deletions(-)

diff --git a/app/SettingsSearchModel.cpp b/app/SettingsSearchModel.cpp
